AASHOOR KO NOUHA THA YAHI BINTE ALI KA <br>
KATT JAYEGA AB PYAASA GALA SIBTE NABI KA<br>
<br>
1. BETOUN KE JANAZOUN PE KIYA SHUKR KA SAJDA <br>
 DEKHAY TOU KOI HOUSLA YE BINTE ALI KA<br>
<br>
2. PAMAAL BANA HOGAYA JAB DASHTE BALA MAY <br>
 FARWA NE KAHA LUTT GAYA AB RAAJ BANI KA<br>
<br>
4. SHAI KAHTE THAY ABBAS KE LASHE PA YE ROOKAR <br>
 KYA HAAL LAYEENO NE KIYA MERE AQII KA<br>
<br>
6. ABBAS E ALI SOOGAYE DARYA KE KINAARE <br>
 ALLAH NIGEHBAAN HAI AB AAL E NABI KA<br>
<br>
7. SHAI KEHNE LAGE AAKAY YE LAASHE PA PISAR KE <br>
 AYE LAAL AJAB HAAL HAI AB TERI PHUPI KA<br>
<br>
8. ROOTI RAHI ZINDAN MAY WO KHOON KE AANSUN <br>
 HAR LAMHA SAKINA KI THA GHAM BE PIDARI KA<br>
<br>
9. KYA GUZRI HAI SAHIL DIL E ZAINAB PE NA POOCHO <br>
 BARBAD GULISTAN HUWA JAB BINTE NABI KA<br>
<br>
